---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
import site from '../data/site.json';

/*
 * Placeholder. The consent checkbox in step 3 links here, so this page must
 * exist — a consent control pointing at a 404 is worse than no link at all.
 *
 * This is deliberately NOT a privacy policy. Writing one would mean inventing
 * the controller's identity, retention periods and legal basis (CLAUDE.md 12).
 * What follows is only a factual statement of what the form collects, which is
 * verifiable from the code. The real policy must cover BOTH UK and EU GDPR,
 * because the business serves customers across Europe (CLAUDE.md 11), and the
 * site must not launch without it.
 */
---

<Base
  title="Privacy — [AWAITING COPY: trading name]"
  description="How enquiry details submitted through this site are used."
>
  <div class="mx-auto max-w-page px-gutter pt-section pb-section">
    <h1 class="max-w-content font-serif text-heading text-ink">Privacy</h1>

    <div class="mt-6 max-w-content rounded-sm border border-line-strong bg-surface p-6">
      <p class="font-medium text-ink">
        [AWAITING: full privacy policy, covering both UK GDPR and EU GDPR.]
      </p>
      <p class="mt-2 text-sm text-ink-muted">
        This site must not go live until this page carries a real policy. See
        MISSING-ASSETS.md section 6.
      </p>
    </div>

    <h2 class="mt-10 font-serif text-xl text-ink">What the enquiry form collects</h2>
    <p class="mt-4 max-w-content text-ink-muted">
      Accurate as of the current build, and limited to what is needed to reply with a quote:
    </p>
    <ul class="mt-4 max-w-content list-disc space-y-1 pl-5 text-ink-muted">
      <li>Your name, phone number and email address</li>
      <li>Your country and postcode, so we can quote for delivery</li>
      <li>The appliances you asked about — the link or model number you sent, and any note</li>
    </ul>
    <p class="mt-4 max-w-content text-ink-muted">
      No full address, no date of birth, and no marketing sign-up. The site sets no cookies and
      uses no advertising or tracking tags.
    </p>

    <h2 class="mt-10 font-serif text-xl text-ink">Where it is held</h2>
    <p class="mt-4 max-w-content text-ink-muted">
      Your unfinished enquiry is kept in your own browser so you can come back to it, and is
      discarded after 30 days or as soon as it is sent. You can clear it at any time with
      &ldquo;Start again&rdquo; on the enquiry page.
    </p>

    <h2 class="mt-10 font-serif text-xl text-ink">Contact</h2>
    <p class="mt-4 max-w-content text-ink-muted">{site.contact.email}</p>
  </div>
</Base>
